# Mosaic runtime storage
# SQLite database (and WAL/SHM sidecar files) is runtime state, not tracked.
# Brief JSON files under memory/morning/ and memory/evening/ are kept under
# version control as historical intelligence records.
.mosaic_memory/
mosaic_memory/
memory/*.db
memory/*.db-shm
memory/*.db-wal

